<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3YW - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">3 YWAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan wàtär wà Ywan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 YWAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yw</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan wàtär wà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ywan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1"/>Mɛ undweer, an'sɔ̈ɔ̈n Gäyus, awà in'kwen mɛ unsà pɛɛlà a ndandaa. <verse eid="3JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2"/>Nkwen amɛ, mɛ in'kwen naa ngye aböŋ unsà indiir byanswà, akäl ubwaŋ, anà un'swey a mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye ukyen usà. <verse eid="3JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3"/>Abun, mɛ kàsäŋ mbɔɔn, ntɔn atɔŋ bàyi pà bàmutà imbäl a ndandaa ikamɛnà u mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye: ngye, ngye awà uboo a ndandaa. <verse eid="3JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4"/>Un'sak amɛ wà mbɔɔn muwem naa mɔ̈ɔ̈ a baan amɛ wà uboo a ndandaa. <verse eid="3JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5"/>Un'sam, ngye awà wàlää unsà indiir akyerà ngye ntɔn atɔŋ, itàkal ntɔn angyey. <verse eid="3JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6"/>Ba bàtɛ imbäl a un'kaay angye kusà a Ikööŋ. Ngye asàkyer ubwaŋ mukapà indiir byanswà abà ba abyà mfun ntɔn nkyeen aba, asànaa ukwen Nzam. <verse eid="3JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7"/>Yà ntɔn ikɔb a Yɛsu waa ba bàwɛl mbwo mukyà, ukɔɔn akyey akà undiir mwɛy akà baar mpa abà Ayudà. <verse eid="3JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8"/>Abun, abà buur abi mukaar baar a tub abà, anà bi mukal abaay ntɔn ndandaa.<verse eid="3JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyɔtɛrfɛs anà Dɛmɛtriyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9"/>Mɛ kàsɔ̈ɔ̈n Ikööŋ undiir mwɛy, wɛɛ Dyɔtɛrfɛs awà akwen muyaal indiir byanswà, nde bi ufiwal anki. <verse eid="3JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10"/>Mpal in'yàyà mɛ sye, mɛ in'kyer ayàsà kà imɛɛy nsyääl ande, nde mbuur afàpay làsaŋ a làbe ntɔn bi: kà nà ntɔn abwɛy mpel anki, nde kàkyer atɔn nde ŋakwo muwal atɔŋ abà bàlyaaŋ. Baar abà bàlàwal atɔŋ abà, nde ba kàkyer atsuŋ anà kàkyer aböŋ kà Ikööŋ.<verse eid="3JN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11"/>Un'sam amɛ, twon an'lab ube, wɛɛ lab ubwaŋ. Mbuur afàkyer ubwaŋ wà wà Nzam, mbuur afàkyer ube uyöb anki Nzam.<verse eid="3JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12"/>Wɛɛ, ntɔn Dɛmɛtiris, mbuur wanswà afun'tɛɛl imbäl aŋàbwaŋ. Ndandaa ŋakwo yàmutà imbäl ntɔn nde. Wɛɛ bi sye, bi kun'tɛɛl imbäl, anà ngye akyàyɔ̈b naa imbäl a bi kyà ndandaa.<verse eid="3JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13"/>Mɛ in'yàkal anà indiir mukasöön, wɛɛ mɛ in'kwen anki mukyer anà tin anà inzar. <verse eid="3JN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14"/>Ntɔn, mɛ in'sii mukaman itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy anà bi, bi ikyer asàyäm u ndaa a duu.<verse eid="3JN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15"/>Wɛy duu làkäl anà ngye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Atɔŋ angye bàmapà mbɔr. Mbɔr akà asam, akà mbuur mbuur ukɔl.<verse eid="3JN 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1"/>
</usx>
